Package: SparseArray
Type: Package
Title: Build Temporal Sparse Arrays from OHDSI Cohort Features
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Study", "Team", email = "study@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates study cohorts and temporal sequence patient-level
    covariates and converts the persisted artifacts into a deterministic
    three-dimensional sparse array of patient by time position by covariate,
    together with the FeatureExtraction output in long format. Andromeda-backed
    processing limits in-memory work while retaining the source identifier maps.
